/E (Many dedicated, knowledgeable people who work every day to help identify and address the ramifications of structural racism and the War on Drugs supported the creation of this report. We would like to thank Yusuf Dahl, CEO of The Century Promise and founder of the Real Estate Lab, for his advocacy and efforts to repeal the Thurmond Amendment and for advising on the creation of this report. We share our gratitude to Shaun Woods and Tara Bruno for their willingness to share their stories on how the Thurmond Amendment has impacted them. We would like to thank DAO Assistant District Attorneys Andrew Silva and Shawn Baldwin who supported the legal research and writing on the Thurmond Amendment and National Fair Futures act. Finally, we thank members of the District Attorney's Transparency Analytics \(DATA\) Lab including primary authors Eliza Ziegler, Wes Weaver, Andrew Silva, and Kate Kelly with support from Arielle Landau, Chloe Desir, CJ Arayata, Betsey Carroll, and Oren Gur. )
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
